**Shipping a release** (OTA `update:*`, `release:ios:*` / `release:android:*`, a version bump, `build:orchestrator`, the camstack-server submodule pin): read `.claude/skills/camstack-viewer-release/SKILL.md` first and follow it.

- **Write the `src/app/whats-new.ts` entry FIRST** — one short line per change, en + it, under 90 characters. The ship scripts run `node scripts/lib/check-whats-new.js` and refuse to bump without it.
- Check viewer CI before shipping (`gh run list --repo camstack/viewer`); a red CI does not stop an OTA.
- `runtimeVersion` stays fixed on an OTA and moves only on a native release.
- Never persist `EXPO_TOKEN`; pass it inline.
